{"server":"tw","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_09_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_09","title":"得果","storyCode":"HS-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b9e61f51bb4f9a7b4642cc37ea3fc74676e2684c579eae1b4ed300d35965c336","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在炎國的北邊，有一片荒地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和那裡的人們正試著開墾農田。看著一棵棵莊稼從地裡長出來，也是十分有趣。不知道該去哪，要不要來這裡幫幫我的忙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……比起這些城鎮要荒涼許多，再加上還有一些東西從那扇門裡跑出來，有點危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你要是想知道，“人”是什麼樣的，那裡說不定是個不錯的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間還長，可以慢慢找答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是稀奇，昨晚冰雹下那麼大，這些莊稼看起來竟然一點事都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是運氣好呢？老天看大家種地辛苦，發了點善心呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"績，是你做的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是覺得，大家辛辛苦苦工作半年，就因為這一場冰雹毀於一旦，實在是可惜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世間萬物都有自己的運行規律，一季莊稼毀了，埋在地裡，還能化作土地的肥料，來年的莊稼可以長得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救得了這片地的這一季莊稼，可炎國有多少片這樣的農田，有多少靠天吃飯的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是好心，但人們總要靠自己研究出在這片土地上找活路的辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，您也會離去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辛勞的農民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這片土地會永遠存在，生命將永遠存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是來收糧食的商人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今年各地大旱，聽說北邊這裡的糧倉還有餘裕。我來進點糧食，賣到糧食更緊張的地方去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天地不仁風雨不調，實在是苦了這些農民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是荒年，對農民來說未必不是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生莫不是在說夢話，荒年對農民來說怎麼會是好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多簡單的道理，越是荒年，糧食越貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每斤糧食賺一文，賣五百斤，和每斤糧食賺十文，賣一百斤。這筆帳三歲小孩都算得清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小就生活在這，只知道糧食是用來餵飽百姓，救人性命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的天地，竟還有這樣的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又沒見過大荒城外的世面，並非人人都是臨淵忘水的神人，只是守著這幾畝田地，哪能悟出天下那麼多道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，我的商隊剛好缺一個管事，你有沒有興趣，跟我一起去走走？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶葉商販","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老規矩，貨存倉庫，先結帳，再住店。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年尚蜀開出來不少茶田，您說要來做茶葉生意。怎麼只是在這包下了這一片客棧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一車最上品的“蜀山青”，從這裡運到百灶，能賺多少錢，朝廷抽幾成稅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上要是平安順利，能有兩成毛利——已經是相當好做的買賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是這來來往往，不願意老實納稅的茶商都要從這條小路上走，我又能抽多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣看來，還是您做的這筆買賣划算……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我分明看到，您扣過一些貨物交給了官府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就是另一筆生意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在官府工作的人，也是要交差的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您做這個生意，既不怕官府找麻煩，也不怕這些茶商捅刀子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣對他們來說都不是划算買賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒了我，茶商要嘛老老實實繳納稅款，要嘛冒著風險再找運貨的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒了我，官府重新網羅這些走私販的消息得花多少錢；再或者，官逼商反，平叛又要花多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三贏的買賣，的確是難得的划算生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在尚蜀待了有段時間了，這裡的菜色差不多吃膩了。把這邊的生意交給別人打理，我們再往東邊走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去東邊，做什麼生意？礦產，漕運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼生意賺錢，就做什麼生意……這一次，主要還是想回家看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是問我，有沒有一句放之四海而皆準的道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天下熙熙，皆為利來；天下攘攘，皆為利往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法理道德，信仰名譽，世上沒有不能寫在帳本上的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……受教了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我算了一筆帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年來，我們兄弟姐妹活在這炎國，各自的帳本上，盈虧如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥找到了自己的道，但始終不容於世，於人間愛不得、恨不得、糾纏不得，是虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令姐逍遙自在，這片天地困不住她，自得其樂，是盈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有幾個妹妹，不見得通透，倒也沒什麼煩惱，不盈不虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於二哥……總之，頡死了，無論如何，都是大虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一家和炎國人打了一千年的交道，任由他們差遣，這筆帳，我實在算不出我們有半點好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……最重要的，是你，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真是半點都不曾把利益得失放在心上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取而代之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了復仇，也為我們，賭一個結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……怎麼能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二分之一，怎麼能贏過整體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事成敗幾何……你又有多少把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我算過很久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棋盤縱橫十九道，棋路算盡……執黑先行者貼七目半，無半分可勝之機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只靠我一人，確實很難做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以需要一些你的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若是我告訴你，如果還有那唯一一點可能，唯有此路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你願不願意，賭上全部身家性命？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g16_beautifulland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你追得很緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生對自己當下所作所為或許得有個解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子想要怎樣的解釋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挑動邪魔危害百姓，篡奪國家工事，還有，謀害其他代理人生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的所作所為，罪責比起望猶有過之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然對這些罪狀我還有些異議，不過，左公子現在想要怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出那匹布，在司歲台的監視下回到京城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按你說的做，我會得到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個聽候判決的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，這個價格我不太想接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要與炎國為敵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算如此，左公子又能做到什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左樂上前一步，拔出了刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欺負普通人，有意思嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好小子，居然跟到了這裡來，不得不說，要對你刮目相看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來是家務事，麻煩司歲台給我們一點私人空間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們從那顆“心臟”裡逃出來，動作比我預想的要快一點。我的妹妹們心態也成熟了不少啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得好像大家關係很好一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當這是考驗？我還以為你是存心想幹掉我們來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你銷聲匿跡這麼多年，就是為了織這匹布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿大炎“國祚”織衣服，真有你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去見祂之前，需要這個東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走遍了炎國各地，最後決定要把大荒城織進去的時候，還是有些捨不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們果然是串通好的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他難道都已經準備好了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早該想到，你才是最容易和那個臭棋簍子聊得來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說你不知道，你把這匹布從這裡帶出去，意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是對炎國明晃晃的宣戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三哥，說實話，在幾個哥哥姐姐裡我還挺喜歡你的。總覺得很多時候我們能碰撞出挺不錯的主意來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早些時候，你拉著我到處賣夕的贗品畫，我也幫了你不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這種事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但抱歉啦，這一次，連我都覺得你還是太激進了點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，夕妹也不願意站在我這邊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾百年沒有搞過三人以上的家庭派對了，要做的第一件事居然是回到打打殺殺的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算什麼，憶苦飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能和和氣氣談判解決的事，我也希望可以不用動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對妹妹，我怎麼下得了手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別說大話，二對一，你贏面沒那麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能試試看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，就算當年大狩獵的那支軍隊站在這裡，也攔不住我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
